---
---

<section id="team" class="relative bg-ink py-28">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 lg:px-10">
    <div class="grid items-center gap-16 lg:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="reveal relative order-2 lg:order-1">
        <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-white/10">
          <img
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600880292203-757bb62b4baf?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=80"
            alt="Experienced trading team reviewing strategy together"
            class="h-[440px] w-full object-cover"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="reveal order-1 lg:order-2">
        <p class="mb-4 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-gold">
          Our Traders
        </p>
        <h2 class="text-balance font-display text-4xl font-medium leading-tight text-paper sm:text-5xl">
          Significant experience trading serious capital
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-6 text-balance text-lg leading-relaxed text-ash">
          The team behind Fortitude Endeavours has spent years trading large
          funds across forex and commodity markets. That experience shapes every
          decision we make: disciplined risk management, defined strategy, and a
          refusal to chase results at the expense of our investors' capital.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-balance text-lg leading-relaxed text-ash">
          We built this fund because we believe the same tools institutional traders
          use to build wealth should be available to individual investors and their
          families, with the transparency and safeguards to match.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-2 gap-6 border-t border-white/10 pt-8">
          <div>
            <p class="font-display text-2xl text-gold">Institutional</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-ash-2">Grade experience</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="font-display text-2xl text-gold">Disciplined</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-ash-2">Risk management</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
